     "<u></u>\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    <p>Hi Pedro and list,</p>\r\n    <p>The examples are now at</p>\r\n    <p><a href=\"https://distancesampling.org/resources/vignettes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://distancesampling.org/resources/vignettes.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471420947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3t6LoKP295vvuhp7goMFPd\">https://distancesampling.org/resources/vignettes.html</a></p>\r\n    <p>and also at each package&#39;s web site at the top under &quot;Articles&quot; -\r\n      see, e.g.,</p>\r\n    <p><a href=\"https://distancesampling.org/Distance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://distancesampling.org/Distance/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471420947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36eIrwp3FqnU1W1JC-fa8P\">https://distancesampling.org/Distance/</a></p>\r\n    <p>On that Distance web site page the first three also come with the\r\n      package, as vignettes, while the rest (under &quot;Only for the web\r\n      site&quot;) are only available via the <a href=\"http://distancesampling.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://distancesampling.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471420947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Mvs71WWNRC4YYvIvjT8QJ\">distancesampling.org</a> web site.</p>\r\n    <p>I thought we&#39;d cleared out references to\r\n      <a href=\"http://examples.distancesampling.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://examples.distancesampling.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471420947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3BTwM9HyKcJo6Sf6rcUukQ\">examples.distancesampling.org</a> from our documentation - but it\r\n      looks like we missed some, so we&#39;ll get that fixed on the next\r\n      release.  I&#39;ll also see if I can get some kind of forwarding in\r\n      place for folks visiting <a href=\"http://examples.distancesampling.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://examples.distancesampling.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471420947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1E2xo1jeS-e7Efz9TZcMQC\">http://examples.distancesampling.org/</a>.</p>\r\n    <p>Cheers, Len Thomas</p>\r\n    <div>On 21/08/2026 17:06, Pedro Eça wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background:revert!important;border:revert!important;color:revert!important;direction:revert!important;display:revert!important;font-size:revert!important;height:revert!important;letter-spacing:revert!important;line-height:revert!important;margin:revert!important;opacity:revert!important;outline:revert!important;overflow:revert!important;padding:revert!important;table-layout:revert!important;text-align:revert!important;text-indent:revert!important;text-orientation:revert!important;text-overflow:revert!important;text-transform:revert!important;vertical-align:revert!important;white-space:revert!important;width:revert!important;word-break:revert!important;word-spacing:revert!important;writing-mode:revert!important;zoom:revert!important;border:0!important;display:table!important;width:100%!important;table-layout:fixed!important;border-collapse:seperate!important;float:none!important;border-spacing:0px 0px!important\" align=\"left\">\r\n        <tbody style=\"background:revert!important;border:revert!important;color:revert!important;direction:revert!important;display:revert!important;font-size:revert!important;height:revert!important;letter-spacing:revert!important;line-height:revert!important;margin:revert!important;opacity:revert!important;outline:revert!important;overflow:revert!important;padding:revert!important;table-layout:revert!important;text-align:revert!important;text-indent:revert!important;text-orientation:revert!important;text